 too early to think about 2020, but there's a lot of different views on how 2020 could be shaping up with where commodity prices are now and then still we're waiting to hear on more so on China trade war, but could you give any initial thoughts?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/30/agco-corp-agco-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"AGCO 2019 Q2","e":"agco","d":"2019-07-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Andrew H. Beck","x":"Our plan includes market share improvement with price increases of 2% to 2.5% on a consolidated basis.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/30/agco-corp-agco-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"AGCO 2019 Q2","e":"agco","d":"2019-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Eric P. Hansotia","x":"Product cost reduction is an area as we went through so much rapid change over the last few years with the emission changes and so on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/30/agco-corp-agco-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"AGCO 2019 Q3","e":"agco","d":"2019-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Greg Peterson","x":"Price increases as well as cost control initiatives and productivity improvement efforts allowed us to offset the impact of lower sales and production volumes in the third quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/29/agco-corp-agco-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"AGCO 2019 Q3","e":"agco","d":"2019-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Greg Peterson","x":"Our plan includes market share improvements, with price increases of approximately 2% on a consolidated basis.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/29/agco-corp-agco-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"AGCO 2019 Q4","e":"agco","d":"2020-02-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Martin H. Richenhagen","x":"We are targeting margin expansion and earnings growth, driven