26-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AGCO 2026 Q2","e":"agco","d":"2026-07-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Damon J. Audia","x":"Results continue to reflect tariff-related costs as well as factory absorption associated with our demand-aligned production approach.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/07/30/agco-agco-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AGCO 2026 Q2","e":"agco","d":"2026-07-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Damon J. Audia","x":"Cost optimization and positive pricing contributed to the stable operating margins year-over-year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/07/30/agco-agco-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AGCO 2026 Q2","e":"agco","d":"2026-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Damon J. Audia","x":"Trying to right size those dealer inventories.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/07/30/agco-agco-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AGCO 2026 Q2","e":"agco","d":"2026-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Damon J. Audia","x":"So the organizational restructuring that we have been talking about that $60 million to $70 million that we are gonna monetize this year, Things that are being put in place this year, there will be a little bit of a carryover next year, so we think that will be an opportunity.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/07/30/agco-agco-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AGCO 2026 Q2","e":"agco","d":"2026-07-30","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Jamie Cook","x":"First, Damon, just on your I am not surprised you are lowering guidance for the back half of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/07/30/agco-agco-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AGCO 2026 Q3","e":"agco","d":"2026-10-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Indira Agarwal","x":"Higher sales and production volumes, combined with approximately $13 million of certain IEEPA tariff refunds reco